OL,3,AGlobal tech stocks plunge as US
OL,4,Amidterms add to AI slowdown fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrillions of dollars has been wiped off
OL,7,Fthe stock value of major tech firms in
OL,8,Fthe US, Europe and Asia in a market
OL,9,Frout after the US midterm elections
OL,10,Fsparked concerns of a slowdown in
OL,11,Fartificial intelligence (AI)
OL,12,Fdevelopment.
OL,14,FShares in firms across the tech sector
OL,15,Fplummeted following Democratic wins
OL,16,Fafter election campaigns run on slowing
OL,17,FAI.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
