OL,3,AThe Russell Brand I saw in court was
OL,4,Anot the flamboyant character most
OL,5,Apeople will know
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis was not the Russell Brand most
OL,8,Fpeople will remember from the height of
OL,9,Fhis noughties TV and comedy fame.
OL,11,FThe flamboyant character with big
OL,12,Fgestures and provocative one-liners was
OL,13,Fnot the man we saw in the courtroom.
OL,15,FDuring his rape trial, Brand mostly sat
OL,16,Fimpassively in the dock, staring
OL,17,Fstraight ahead. His stillness was
OL,18,Fstriking. His face betrayed no visible
OL,19,Femotion or reaction as the string of
OL,20,Fallegations against him were outlined
OL,21,Fin detail over several days.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
